    crgo:CRGO_0000252 "A clinician's tablet or handheld used for EHR access is lost or stolen; because device encryption, screen lock and remote wipe are not centrally enforced, patient data cached on the device or accessible through saved sessions is exposed."@en ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000253 "A tablet is stolen from a car. It has no enforced PIN and holds downloaded referral letters; the EHR app remains logged in. Loss is reported two days later."@en ;
