    crgo:CRGO_0000252 "Patient exports, scanned documents and imaging copies accumulate on local clinic storage units outside central access control, retention and monitoring; an insider, intruder or misconfigured share exposes them, or they are lost without backup."@en ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000253 "A shared folder 'Scans' on a clinic storage unit is readable by all domain users and contains eight years of referral letters. A compromised account indexes it; separately, a disk failure destroys files that were never backed up."@en ;
