    crgo:CRGO_0000252 "A fraudster spoofs or compromises a supplier or executive mailbox and instructs MediBec finance staff to change bank details or pay a fraudulent invoice, because payment-change verification and e-mail authentication are weak, resulting in direct financial loss."@en ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000253 "A look-alike supplier domain sends an updated banking form before a large equipment invoice. Accounts payable updates the vendor record by e-mail; CAD 180,000 is transferred before the real supplier chases payment."@en ;
