    crgo:CRGO_0000252 "A staff member unintentionally discloses patient information - misdirected e-mail or fax, wrong attachment, record uploaded to a personal cloud, or document handed to the wrong patient - because data-handling controls and awareness are limited, resulting in privacy incidents and patient complaints."@en ;
