    crgo:CRGO_0000252 "An attacker positioned on the clinic network or WAN captures or alters unencrypted HL7 lab/pharmacy messages or DICOM image transfers between clinical systems, exposing results or injecting false values that flow into the EHR."@en ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000253 "An attacker with a foothold in a clinic uses ARP spoofing to intercept lab result messages to the EHR, harvesting results and altering several potassium values."@en ;
