    crgo:CRGO_0000252 "An opportunistic actor finds an API key, database connection string or cloud access token that a developer committed to a code repository, left in a log or embedded in a configuration file, and uses it to call MediBec's EHR integration or cloud storage APIs directly, extracting patient data without passing through user authentication."@en ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000253 "A developer pushes a test script containing a storage access key to a public repository. Within hours automated scanners harvest it; an actor lists and downloads patient export files and queries an integration endpoint until the key is revoked weeks later."@en ;
