    crgo:CRGO_0000252 "Malware on a patient-supplied imaging CD/USB or a staff USB drive executes on a radiology workstation or device console when the media is loaded, infecting systems that are poorly protected by endpoint security and connected to the clinical network."@en ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000253 "A patient brings imaging from an outside clinic on a USB key infected with a worm. The import station, running an unsupported OS without EDR, is infected and spreads to a neighbouring modality console."@en ;
