    crgo:CRGO_0000252 "Clinicians and administrative staff use public generative-AI tools to summarize notes, draft letters or translate documents, pasting identifiable patient information into services whose data retention, training use and location MediBec has not assessed, resulting in uncontrolled disclosure of health information."@en ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000253 "Clinicians use a free chatbot to turn dictated notes into referral letters. Over months, thousands of identifiable notes are submitted to a service that retains prompts outside Canada."@en ;
