    crgo:CRGO_0000252 "Fraudsters register look-alike domains and send SMS or e-mail messages posing as MediBec (appointment confirmations, billing notices, results available) to harvest patients' credentials, health-card details or payments, harming patients and eroding trust even though MediBec's systems are not breached."@en ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000253 "Patients receive texts 'MediBec: your results are ready, confirm identity' linking to a copy of the portal. Hundreds enter credentials and health-card numbers; front desks receive angry calls."@en ;
