    crgo:CRGO_0000252 "An attacker finds management interfaces (remote desktop, hypervisor or firewall consoles, storage or out-of-band management) exposed to the internet or partner networks and gains access by credential stuffing or default passwords, obtaining administrative control of infrastructure."@en ;
