    crgo:CRGO_0000252 "A disgruntled or departing IT administrator with broad standing privileges deletes backups, disables accounts or plants logic bombs; with a 15-person IT team and concentrated knowledge, MediBec cannot quickly detect or reverse the actions, causing prolonged outages."@en ;
