    crgo:CRGO_0000252 "An attacker reaching a clinic network (through malware, a compromised clinic Wi-Fi or vendor access) exploits an unpatched or default-credential medical device on a network shared with EHR workstations, disrupting device operation and using it as a persistent foothold, with potential consequences for patient care."@en ;
