    crgo:CRGO_0000252 "An intrusion by any external actor goes unnoticed or is misclassified because alert triage, log coverage and after-hours monitoring are insufficient for a two-person cybersecurity team, and the untested incident response plan leads to slow, uncoordinated containment, turning a contained event into a major privacy and operational incident."@en ;
    crgo:CRGO_0000253 "Across ten days, four weak signals (phishing, PowerShell, unusual login, cloud download) are visible in different consoles but no one correlates them. When encryption begins, roles, forensic engagement and clinical workarounds are improvised."@en ;
