    crgo:CRGO_0000326 "Clinics depend heavily on central services in Montreal (E1, E2). The exercise timeline shows the full chain - phishing, PowerShell alert closed as low, backup failures, ransom note (E6). Segmentation and backup isolation are listed as open questions (E2, E7)."@en .

